hadiths[19]{hadithnumber,text}:
"860","Ubayy ibn Ka'b mentioned that the Messenger of Allah"
"861","Al-Aswad ibn Suray' said"
"862","Abu Hurayra reported that the Messenger of Allah"
"863","Al-Aswad ibn Suray' said"
"864","'A'isha said"
"865","Hisham reported that his father said"
"866","See hadith 858."
"867","'Abdullah ibn 'Amr reported that the Messenger of Allah"
"868","'A'isha said"
"869","Ibn 'Abbas said that a man - or a bedouin - came to the\nProphet"
"870","See hadith 859."
"871","Ash-Sharid said"
"872","Ibn 'Umar reported that the Prophet"
"873","In respect of """"And as for the poets"
"874","Ibn 'Abbas said that a man - or a bedouin - came to the\nProphet"
"875","'Abdu'l-Malik ibn Marwan entrusted the teaching of his children\nto ash-Sha'bi and said"
"876","'A'isha reported that the Prophet"
"877","Ibn 'Umar said"
"878","Anas said"
